invariant: INV-33
file: webpki_pin.c
catches: webpki_auth_test
reason: webpki_path_pinned stops at the path's last certificate and
  never hashes the anchor that verified it, so a pin on the root the
  caller trusts refuses every chain under it. bin/webpki_auth_test's
  rows that pin each chain's anchor object.

--- old
    pinned |= webpki_spki_pinned(cfg, anchor->spki, anchor->spki_len);
--- new
    (void)anchor;
